---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Software projects built by Mika Flowers.">
  <section>
    <p class="kicker">things from the workbench</p>
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <p>Small software with a reason to exist.</p>
    <ul class="project-list">
      <li><h3><a href="https://github.com/miflow13/mochi-desktop">Mochi 🌱</a></h3><p class="meta">early public alpha · python / gtk4 / cairo</p><p>A handcrafted Linux desktop companion that wanders, sleeps, reacts to desktop activity, and tries to feel like one coherent little character.</p><p><a href="https://miflow13.github.io/mochi-desktop/">website →</a></p></li>
      <li><h3><a href="https://github.com/miflow13/KeyFlip">KeyFlip</a></h3><p class="meta">linux utility</p><p>A small Linux utility for quickly toggling a laptop's internal keyboard while leaving external keyboards alone.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
